# Internationalization

- Use next-i18next (or the App Router equivalent in this stack) for copy
- Detect locale correctly; do not hard-code user-facing strings in components
- Format numbers, dates, and currency with locale-aware APIs
- Support RTL layouts (`dir="rtl"`, logical CSS / Tailwind logical utilities)

```ts
new Intl.NumberFormat(locale, {
	style: 'currency',
	currency: 'USD',
}).format(amount)
```
